  1 4 | b3
  5 2 | a8
  7 2 | 2f
  11 4 | b4
  14 4 | 64
  5 11 | ec
  5 14 | ad
  7 11 | fb

For any 4-set e, put a=|e intersect A|.  It is a hyperedge exactly when:
